# dynatrace_openpipeline_primary_grail_tag (Resource)

-> This resource requires the API token scopes **Read settings** (`settings.read`) and **Write settings** (`settings.write`) or the OAuth scopes **Read settings** (`settings:objects:read`) and **Write settings** (`settings:objects:write`)

## Dynatrace Documentation

- Set primary Grail tag rules in OpenPipeline - https://docs.dynatrace.com/docs/platform/openpipeline/get-started/primary-grail-tags

- Settings API - https://www.dynatrace.com/support/help/dynatrace-api/environment-api/settings (schemaId: `builtin:openpipeline.primary-grail-tag`)

## Export Example Usage

- `terraform-provider-dynatrace -export dynatrace_openpipeline_primary_grail_tag` downloads all existing primary Grail tag rules

The full documentation of the export feature is available [here](https://dt-url.net/h203qmc).

